      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `a3e19c956a82576abd3768d2ea7aac6bce50fcc101a3cde9be4ea5ca89aa1012--45150do001_201011.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Federal Defendants, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 14 of 14\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 71c85a434ac7116821d8c1c08ce5049af3937bf105ff886d05f8a5c7cd417710 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | e18a6ee124efc985c545ec5a9f468c78f51c1b374594b7ffa77d1736e7f9b900 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 72354a93836d868552999a60772070b070ed50175e88d543d37249ba8de52a07 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 62769862628dc9c5fad2fbc794de4e504617fc3d59477e536e828d0ed059c4a5 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 822b8aec720c2cb13f2b74d1072274ef549369aaf06f95f02eb39743a9c61027 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 34be5b877faf23844a7037f729fceb5545dfd4078a1ddd0e4c2a880862121f39 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 838072d19454e035eda3a7e37c10170adca8f31dde1343454191a24c1b16d751 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | ba08089d672c3e909f4eafc7b6c3c1e7f11216d274bb9203ae7cb2fea89cc845 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 99f405951bbab29375403252ecd071f7e13b84cd7ba9f17219a2d4e65ae4bd26 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 2a591953af9181fd0ef4faca444fe7b691bebeec60d14c19af90b21dda48fdf9 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | c8e83a45cfb72d425b61c956e2b8101982f7a29e151adcbd7d2c99f79d37d53a | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 988eded2b995e1f2622cc6e6aa13f9f3de63aae9a512a9f6a6eb005981b0e2a3 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 9f692470fb5f70cfff81004bb903593c3854bbc68755af6e0b3112788eb1402e | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | a7c3a6d25a64a8f7543151b4a85c9ef64cd69001fcb5ae6ed39d79ee1a2d0b1d | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at